rooms_desc ({"You are in entrance to Tomas's house. Small chamber is west.At north begining passageway to next rooms.","Small chamber used by Tomas as store. If you want, you candrop some good items there. This room is very dark, but yousee picture on wall.","You going through hallway. There is big window and opposite door leading to wine cellar. Beside window stay stone statuerepresent some great Jedi knight. Floor is covered with carpet.","You enter the wine cellar. There is cool and you cansmell water in the air. The cellar looks very old.Beside northern wall you notice line of wine barrels.Small table stay in middle of room. On the tablelies piece of cheese, some bread and empty bottle.","You are in living room. There are two doors, western leadingto Tomas's workroom and eastern to bedroom. Northern wall ismade from glass and you can see big part of lake. Room isfurnish with MUD-Tv and videorecorder. The cougch andlow-lying table stay in centre of room. Some pictures fromgreat painters hanging at walls. Small flickering fireburnish into fireplace. You hear ticktack clock.","You stay into large room. The work's table with turning-chairstay before fireplace near southern wall. Opposite is leathercougch for visitors. There is safe under map hanging left fromfireplace. Big library with more books, stay beside northerndoor leading to garden. You can see small palm and drink's table in corner.","You stay in comfortable bedroom. Through eastern and northern glass walls you see lake with sailing junks.Big bear's fur covered floor and agreeable appearingbed, inviting you lie down, stay beside norhternpart of room. From the bed is directly look at lake.It must be nice sleep in this room and been awakenby morning's dawn. Small sferical aquarium lie on table under eastern wall. The photo in golden framehanging beside door to living room.","You arrives at terrace. If you look back, you see allTomas's house. The house is builded on rocky ledge.The lake lie down and some people fishing on shore.Dark castle stay over lake on opposite side, smallfishing village is stealth in smoke. Stone path leadingdown to lake begining in west direction. Small table and four chairs stay beside house.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",})
